If now there comes a query that asks the current value of a particular array entry, it is enough to go down the tree and add up all values found along the way.
[/CODE_BLOCK]
cpp
void build(int a[], int v, int tl, int tr) {
if (tl == tr) {
    t[v] = a[tl];
} else {
    int tm = (tl + tr) / 2;
    build(a, v*2, tl, tm);
